flowchart TD
    A([Owner or Editor creates course]) --> B[Check provider membership]
    B --> C[Validate unique slug, platform, URL host and categories]
    C --> D[Save DRAFT with price]
    D --> E[Audit COURSE_CREATED]
    E --> F{Provider ACTIVE and state allows submit?}
    F -- No --> X[409 conflict]
    F -- Yes --> G[Save PENDING, audit and publish status event]
    G --> H{Admin moderation decision}
    H -- Provider edits while PENDING --> U[Save updated DRAFT and audit COURSE_UPDATED]
    H -- APPROVE --> I{Provider ACTIVE?}
    I -- Yes --> J[PUBLISHED]
    I -- No --> X
    H -- REQUEST_REVISION with reason --> K[REVISION_REQUESTED]
    K --> F
    J --> L{Next action}
    L -- Provider edits --> U
    U --> F
    L -- Admin SUSPEND with reason --> M[SUSPENDED]
    M --> N{Admin decision}
    N -- RESTORE and provider ACTIVE --> J
    N -- ARCHIVE with reason --> O[ARCHIVED]
    L -- Admin ARCHIVE with reason --> O
